      "sourceHash": "7871fec74de3232a",
      "translationZh": "XIELU CUDA 内核模板已经对元素类型具有泛型",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df60f8ddec7c7925",
      "translationZh": "类型；只有 F32/F16 类型断言和 else-if 分派缺失",
